# Design §6 case 5 — mode 2 (framework-certified issuers). The verifier enumerates
# NO issuer at all: admissibility is delegated entirely to the eIDAS 2 framework
# individual, so this case cannot pass through the mode-1 branch. Scope conformance
# is left ABSENT, which parses as `true` (the stricter, fail-closed default).
@prefix trustx: <https://sparq.dev/ns/trust#> .
@prefix xsd:    <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<urn:tr:mode2-pass> a trustx:TrustRequirements ;
    trustx:question              <urn:question:jesse-has-an-age> ;
    trustx:trustsFramework       trustx:eIDAS2 ;
    trustx:requiresValidStatusAt "2026-07-05T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .
